		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Un Pokémon de {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} ou\n{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} sera endormi\favant le combat!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0426_00035" index="35">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Un Pokémon de {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}\nsera gelé avant le combat!</language>
